#% title
# fold_while_list

#% text
# `fold_while_list(f, x, xs, test)` gives the list of values `fold_while(f, x, xs, test)` goes through: `x`, then each new value, up to the first for which `test` is not `true`.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
fold_while_list((a, b) => a/b, 120, range(10), is_integer)
#% output
#= [120, 120, 60, 20, 5, 1, 1/6]

